Renzu Grade @PROJECT_VERSION@ -- @RENZU_PACKAGE_PLATFORM@ x86_64, CPU only

@RENZU_INSTALL_INSTRUCTIONS@
The plugin processes images on the CPU; CUDA, OpenCL and Metal are not included.
Resolve's own GPU and system requirements still apply. New effect instances
expect DaVinci Wide Gamut / DaVinci Intermediate; see README.md.

License: GNU GPL version 3 only. Corresponding source, tests, vendored OpenFX
headers and build instructions are included under Source/renzu-grade/.
Build compiler: @CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID@ @CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_VERSION@

Standalone tests do not certify operation inside DaVinci Resolve.
Use docs/manual-test-plan.md for host verification.
